#Production Server Structure (Ubuntu)
Assume your production server already runs Odoo.
Example structure:
/opt/odoo18/
├── odoo/
├── custom-addons/
│   └── sale_custom_discount
├── odoo.conf
Example config:
addons_path = /opt/odoo18/odoo/addons,/opt/odoo18/custom-addons
Your custom modules must be inside
/opt/odoo18/custom-addons

#Create GitHub Repository
Go to GitHub → create repository.
Example repo name:
odoo-custom-addons
clone the repo in my local pc
Repository structure:
odoo-custom-addons/
├── sale_custom_discount/
│   ├── __manifest__.py
│   ├── models/
│   ├── views/
│   └── security/
└── requirements.txt
copy the modules in this cloning repo
Push Module from Local Machine 
Add files:
git add .
git commit -m "Initial module"
git push origin main
Now GitHub contains your module.

#Clone Repository on Production Server

Login to server:
ssh root@your-server-ip
Go to addons folder:
cd /opt/odoo18
Clone repo:
git clone https://github.com/username/odoo-custom-addons.git custom-addons
Now server structure becomes:
/opt/odoo18/
├── odoo/
├── custom-addons/
│   └── sale_custom_discount

# Create GitHub Actions Workflow

Inside your repo create folder:
.github/workflows/
Create file:
.github/workflows/odoo-deploy.yml
Example pipeline:

#Use For VPS Server 

name: Odoo CI/CD
on:
  push:
    branches: [ main ]
jobs:
  test:
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    services:
      postgres:
        image: postgres:14
        env:
          POSTGRES_USER: odoo
          POSTGRES_PASSWORD: odoo
          POSTGRES_DB: postgres
        ports:
          - 5432:5432
    steps:
    - name: Checkout Code
      uses: actions/checkout@v4
    - name: Setup Python
      uses: actions/setup-python@v5
      with:
        python-version: 3.12
    - name: Install dependencies
      run: |
        pip install -r requirements.txt
    - name: Run Module Test
      run: |
        echo "Test step placeholder"
  deploy:
    needs: test
    runs-on: ubuntu-latest
    steps:
    - name: Deploy to Production Server
      uses: appleboy/ssh-action@v1
      with:
        host: ${{ secrets.SERVER_IP }}
        username: ${{ secrets.SERVER_USER }}
        key: ${{ secrets.SERVER_SSH_KEY }}
        script: |
          cd /opt/odoo18/custom-addons
          git pull origin main
          sudo systemctl restart odoo18

